OL,3,GNEWSADisaster 'prepper' asked chatbot
OL,4,Aabout making a bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury has heard how a father-of-two
OL,7,Fmade a "viable" explosive device in his
OL,8,Fflat after consulting an AI chatbot
OL,9,Fabout prepping for disasters.
OL,11,FBen Banham, 38, of Rokescroft in
OL,12,FPitsea, Basildon, also wrote a journal
OL,13,Fin which he referred to a "Project
OL,14,FPrometheus", of which the aim was to
OL,15,Fdefend his family's home using
OL,16,Fgunpowder.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
