OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSADisaster 'prepper' asked chatbot
OL,4,Aabout making a bomb
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 80 addresses were evacuated
OL,7,Fon 10 March after bomb disposal teams
OL,8,Ffound a black cylindrical device with a
OL,9,Fwick or fuse in the top in Banham's
OL,10,Fthree-bedroom property, where he lived
OL,11,Fwith his wife and two young sons.
OL,13,FBanham admits possessing explosives but
OL,14,Fdenies intending to endanger life or
OL,15,Fcause serious injury.
